<title>CHINA: China 1996 zinc exports rise 18.4 percent.</title>
<headline>China 1996 zinc exports rise 18.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought zinc and zinc alloys rose to 226,777 tonnes in 1996, up by 18.4 percent compared with a year ago, customs figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Zinc exports were 29,519 tonnes in December alone.</p>
<p>China exported a total of 191,526 tonnes of zinc in 1995, customs figures showed.</p>
</text>
